      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SERENA BEACH (1) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Dubbo in a handy 18.82 beating Greysynd Quinn. Comes through a solid form race last start. Great chance to get the job done again. KENEBRI (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (20.36) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. TAMARAMA BEACH (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind BURNSIDE LIBBY (20.11) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Leading player again. BAD GIRL SALLY (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
